        1582,
        1489,
        1701
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City continues to establish and implement initiatives to increase equity by providing the most underutilized ethnic and gender categories of M/WBEs with more City contracting opportunities using the M/WBE Noncompetitive Small Purchase method;",
      "logprob_stats": {
